00:22:12.421 --> 00:22:14.633
Once that passes then we go and deploy that

00:22:14.633 --> 00:22:17.348
to the remaining instances within Kubernetes.

00:22:17.348 --> 00:22:18.973
(Melody) Oh! It's green!

00:22:18.973 --> 00:22:20.312
(Morgan) It's green!

00:22:20.312 --> 00:22:22.430
(Melody) Live demo, folks. (chuckles)

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:23.813
(applause)

